      "title": "Wockhardt Q1 results: Revenue rises 26% to ₹929 cr, profit at ₹107 cr",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/companies/quarterly-results/wockhardt-q1-results-revenue-rises-26-to-929-cr-profit-at-107-cr-126081001040_1.html",
      "description": "Pharmaceuticals firm Wockhardt Ltd on Monday reported a consolidated profit after tax of Rs 107 crore for the first quarter ended June 30, mainly due to strong revenue growth.\nThe company had posted a consolidated net loss of Rs 108 crore in the corresponding period of the last fiscal, Wockhardt Ltd said in a regulatory filing.\nIts consolidated revenue from operations in the first quarter stood at Rs 929 crore against Rs 738 crore a year ago, it added.\nTotal expenses in the quarter under review were higher at Rs 844 crore compared to Rs 770 crore in the year-ago period, it said.",
